    "text": "wfdd.org\nwebsite\nGuilford County, North Carolina\nGuilford County's new arts elementary school to be named 'Peeler-Hampton'\n8 hours ago\nThe Guilford County Board of Education voted to name a new arts school after two Black men who played significant roles in Greensboro’s history. The school will be called Peeler-Hampton Visual and Performing Arts Elementary. It combines the names of two schools that closed due to tornado damage. They...\n10",
